+  <data name="Welcome_To_The_Building_Management_System" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Welcome to the Building Management System! This guide walks you step by step through everything you need to know about the system — from logging in to issuing invoices and managing wallets.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="When_You_Open_The_System_You" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>When you open the system, you will find a unified login screen. Follow these steps:</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="1_Enter_The_Mobile_Number_You" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; Enter the &lt;strong&gt;mobile number&lt;/strong&gt; you are registered with (e.g. &lt;code&gt;+201119221000&lt;/code&gt;)</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="2_Enter_Your_PIN_4_Digits" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; Enter your &lt;strong&gt;PIN&lt;/strong&gt; (4 digits)</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="3_Tap_Log_In" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; Tap &lt;strong&gt;"Log in"&lt;/strong&gt;</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="4_If_You_Have_More_Than" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; If you have more than one role (admin + resident), the &lt;strong&gt;context selection&lt;/strong&gt; will appear — choose the one you want to enter with</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Tip_If_You_Forgot_Your_PIN" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>💡 &lt;strong&gt;Tip&lt;/strong&gt;: If you forgot your PIN, ask the admin to set a new PIN for you.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Login_With_QR" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Login with QR</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="If_The_Admin_Sent_You_A" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>If the admin sent you a QR on WhatsApp, scan it with any QR reader app and an automatic login page will open.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Back_To_Top" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>↑ Back to top</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="For_Residents_2" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>🏠 For residents</value>
+  </data>
