+  <data name="Welcome_To_The_Building_Management_System" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Welcome to the Building Management System! This guide walks you step by step through everything you need to know about the system — from logging in to issuing invoices and managing wallets.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="When_You_Open_The_System_You" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>When you open the system, you will find a unified login screen. Follow these steps:</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="1_Enter_The_Mobile_Number_You" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; Enter the &lt;strong&gt;mobile number&lt;/strong&gt; you are registered with (e.g. &lt;code&gt;+201119221000&lt;/code&gt;)</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="2_Enter_Your_PIN_4_Digits" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; Enter your &lt;strong&gt;PIN&lt;/strong&gt; (4 digits)</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="3_Tap_Log_In" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; Tap &lt;strong&gt;"Log in"&lt;/strong&gt;</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="4_If_You_Have_More_Than" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; If you have more than one role (admin + resident), the &lt;strong&gt;context selection&lt;/strong&gt; will appear — choose the one you want to enter with</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Tip_If_You_Forgot_Your_PIN" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>💡 &lt;strong&gt;Tip&lt;/strong&gt;: If you forgot your PIN, ask the admin to set a new PIN for you.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Login_With_QR" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Login with QR</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="If_The_Admin_Sent_You_A" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>If the admin sent you a QR on WhatsApp, scan it with any QR reader app and an automatic login page will open.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Back_To_Top" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>↑ Back to top</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="For_Residents_2" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>🏠 For residents</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="My_Wallet_2" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>💰 My wallet</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="The_ResidentWallet_Page_Shows_You" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>The &lt;code&gt;/ResidentWallet&lt;/code&gt; page shows you:</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Your_Current_Balance_In_The_Selected" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;strong&gt;Your current balance&lt;/strong&gt; in the selected month</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Account_Statement_All_Transactions_Payments_Expe" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;strong&gt;Account statement&lt;/strong&gt; — all transactions (payments, expenses, revenues, adjustments)</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Pending_Payments_Those_Not_Yet_Confirmed" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;strong&gt;Pending payments&lt;/strong&gt; — those not yet confirmed by the admin</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Submit_A_New_Payment" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>📤 Submit a new payment</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="1_In_My_Wallet_Look_For" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; In My wallet, look for the &lt;strong&gt;"Submit payment"&lt;/strong&gt; option</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="2_Enter_The_Amount_And_A" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; Enter the &lt;strong&gt;amount&lt;/strong&gt; and a note</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="3_Optionally_Upload_A_Receipt_Image" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; Optionally, upload a &lt;strong&gt;receipt image&lt;/strong&gt; (InstaPay, bank transfer, etc.)</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="4_Tap_Submit" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;span class="badge-step"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; Tap &lt;strong&gt;"Submit"&lt;/strong&gt;</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Receipt_Image_The_System_Uses_OCR" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>📸 &lt;strong&gt;Receipt image&lt;/strong&gt;: The system uses OCR to read the amount from the image automatically. Still, double-check the amount before submitting.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="After_Submitting_The_Payment_Appears_With" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>After submitting, the payment appears with the status &lt;strong&gt;"Awaiting confirmation"&lt;/strong&gt; until the admin reviews it.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Notifications_2" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>🔔 Notifications</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="On_The_Notifications_Page_You_Will" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>On the &lt;code&gt;/Notifications&lt;/code&gt; page, you will find all notifications addressed to you:</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Payment_Confirmed_When_The_Admin_Confirms" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>✅ &lt;strong&gt;Payment confirmed&lt;/strong&gt; — when the admin confirms your payment</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Payment_Edited_If_The_Admin_Edits" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>✏️ &lt;strong&gt;Payment edited&lt;/strong&gt; — if the admin edits the amount or note of a pending payment</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Payment_Cancelled_If_The_Admin_Cancels" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>❌ &lt;strong&gt;Payment cancelled&lt;/strong&gt; — if the admin cancels a payment</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="New_Expense_When_A_New_Expense" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>💸 &lt;strong&gt;New expense&lt;/strong&gt; — when a new expense is recorded in the building</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Polls_2" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>🗳️ Polls</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="On_The_ResidentPolls_Page_You_Will" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>On the &lt;code&gt;/ResidentPolls&lt;/code&gt; page, you will find the active polls. Each apartment has one vote per poll.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Tap_The_Option_You_Want_Then" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Tap the option you want, then &lt;strong&gt;"Vote"&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;You cannot change your vote afterwards&lt;/strong&gt;.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="For_Admins_2" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>🏢 For admins</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="The_Wallet_Page_Is_The_Heart" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>The &lt;code&gt;/Wallet&lt;/code&gt; page is the heart of the system. It contains:</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Month_Summary_Collected_Expenses_Revenues_Wallet" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;strong&gt;Month summary&lt;/strong&gt; — collected, expenses, revenues, wallet total</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Pending_Payments_All_Payments_That_Need" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;strong&gt;Pending payments&lt;/strong&gt; — all payments that need review</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Apartment_Balances_Each_Apartment_And_Its" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>&lt;strong&gt;Apartment balances&lt;/strong&gt; — each apartment and its balance in the selected month</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Managing_Payments" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>💰 Managing payments</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="For_Each_Pending_Payment_You_Have" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>For each pending payment, you have 3 options:</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Button" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Button</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Action_2" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Action</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Confirm" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Confirm</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="The_Payment_Is_Counted_In_The" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>The payment is counted in the apartment balance, and the resident gets a notification</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Edit_The_Amount_Or_Note_You" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Edit the amount or note (you must enter a reason for the edit)</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="The_Payment_Is_Rejected_And_The" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>The payment is rejected, and the resident gets a notification with the cancellation reason</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Editing_A_Payment_When_You_Edit" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>📝 &lt;strong&gt;Editing a payment&lt;/strong&gt;: When you edit a pending payment, the system records the change in the &lt;strong&gt;edit history&lt;/strong&gt; (editHistory) and sends the &lt;strong&gt;resident a notification&lt;/strong&gt; with the old and new amount and the reason.</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Expenses_And_Revenues" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>💸 Expenses and revenues</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="In_Expenses_And_Revenues_You_Can" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>In &lt;code&gt;/Expenses&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/Revenues&lt;/code&gt;, you can:</value>
+  </data>
+  <data name="Add_An_Expense_Revenue_With_An" xml:space="preserve">
+    <value>Add an expense/revenue with an item, a price and a note</value>
